4. The Homepage (most important part)
The homepage is a React client app mounted at the site root.
`app/page.tsx` — the root route. Imports `./home-next/home.css` and mounts `<HomeApp />`. This is what `signalboostapp.com` serves. (Indexable for SEO.)
`app/home-next/page.tsx` — an older PREVIEW route at `/home-next` (noindex). Same app, used for testing. The root (`app/page.tsx`) is the real one now.
`app/home-next/home.css` — THE homepage stylesheet (~436 lines). Scoped under `.sb-home`. Defines colors via CSS variables at the top, the atmospheric background, animations, and all component styling. To change the whole look, edit the CSS variables at the top of this file.
Homepage components (all in `components/home/`)
File	Purpose
`HomeApp.tsx`	The main orchestrator (~577 lines). Holds state, fetches partners, runs searches (`runQuery`), switches between concierge/browse views. Renders everything below.
`ConciergeHero.tsx`	The hero: "SignalBoost" wordmark, "Your AI-guided digital shopping mall" tagline, rotating "I'll help you find ___" line, search box with teaching placeholders, category door chips, trust line.

`ConciergeThread.tsx`	The search results: partner cards (`<a target="_blank" rel="sponsored">`), opens affiliate site in new tab, fires click analytics.
`HomeSections.tsx`	Below-hero sections: "How it works" (4 steps) + "Popular right now" (tappable use-case pills that run searches).
`NudgeBubble.tsx`	Returning-visitor greeting + idle nudge. Has "Start fresh" button that clears saved memory.
`AdminBar.tsx`	Floating top-right admin bar (⚙ Admin · Dashboard · Reset password · Log out). Only renders for admin email. Self-contained Supabase check with 3s timeout failsafe.
`BrandMark.tsx`	Top-left logo: "signalboost" wordmark + animated signal-emission (pulsing gold arcs). Self-contained SVG + CSS animation.
Theme / look-and-feel
The current look is controlled entirely by the CSS variables at the top of `app/home-next/home.css`. Alternate themes were built and saved (in case of reverting): a dark version, a soft-charcoal version, a white version, and a light "frosted glass / happy" version. To swap themes, replace the variable block + background gradient at the top of `home.css`. Always keep a backup before swapping.
