12. How To Do Common Tasks
Add a partner
Easiest: log in → ⚙ Admin (top-right) → Dashboard → Add a partner → fill the form → Save. It writes to `affiliate_partners` and appears on the site within ~60s. No redeploy.
Manual: Supabase → Table Editor → `affiliate_partners` → Insert row (must hand-enter JSON for regions/regional_urls/placements).
Delete a partner
Supabase → Table Editor → `affiliate_partners` → tick the row → Delete.
Change the homepage look/theme
Edit the CSS variables at the top of `app/home-next/home.css` (the `.sb-home { --bg: ... }` block) and the background gradient just below it. Keep a backup first.
View analytics
Log in → ⚙ Admin → Dashboard → Statistics (`/admin/stats`). For raw traffic, see the Vercel dashboard → Analytics tab.
Deploy
Just commit to `main` on GitHub. Vercel auto-builds and deploys. Tip: if a new npm dependency isn't installing, Vercel may be using the build cache — do a Redeploy with "Use existing Build Cache" UNCHECKED.
