13. Affiliate Link Formats (reference)
Network	Format
Awin	`https://www.awin1.com/cread.php?awinmid=XXXX&awinaffid=2834806`
Travelpayouts	`*.tpo.lv/CODE` (marker-based)
Admitad	redirect domains with `/g/HASH/`
Amazon	region-specific (es-latam → amazon.com.mx)
The affiliate ID (e.g. `awinaffid=2834806`) is what credits commissions — every link must carry the correct one or the sale won't be attributed.
