14. Known Decisions & Gotchas
Partner cards open in a new tab (not embedded). Affiliate sites block iframe embedding (X-Frame-Options), so embedding was abandoned.
The homepage uses its own header/AdminBar, not `SiteHeader`. So the admin tab on the homepage comes from `AdminBar.tsx`, while other pages use `SiteHeader.tsx`.
`public/index.html` (old static homepage) is no longer served (the React `app/page.tsx` took over the root). It can be deleted/renamed to `index.html.bak` for tidiness.
MCP vs API keys: evaluated and decided NOT to pivot to MCP. The site is human-facing with standard REST/key integrations; affiliate networks don't even offer MCP. MCP would only be a future optional add-on endpoint if exposing SignalBoost to external AI agents ever becomes a goal — never a rewrite.
Build cache quirk: Vercel sometimes skips installing new packages ("up to date in 4s"). Fix: Redeploy without build cache.
`"use client";` must be the FIRST line of any client component (before comments), or the build fails.
